From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:33:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Signature slots and Dissemination (building slice 9)

Arcane companions can now carry up to 3 of the guild's own cards within a
rarity point budget (8). Granted cards are added to the companion's starter
deck in every fight. Grants are checked again at each fight: a card the
guild no longer owns, or one past the budget, stays home.

Scriptorum T3 Dissemination is unblocked: granted cards take the tiers of
the guild's best owned copy and the budget rises by 3.

- SignatureService: grant, revoke, candidates, idle checks, combat build
- ForcesScreen: SIGNATURE SPELLS section for arcane companions
- CombatManager: companion starter deck gets the granted cards
- scriptorum.json: Dissemination live
- CharterSaveAssert: signature grant round-trip

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
